                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very fun game, have played it solo and with friends.  With 6 classes and various game modes, has good replayability, not to mention the farming aspect to get gear sets youd want.  Reminds me of a diablo but as a first person.  Dev is very receptive to the community and has good communications.  Would recommend higher if I could.",
